      "The tangible asset base saw a 30% reduction, largely due to the disposal of motor vehicles and ongoing depreciation charges exceeding new investments.",
      "Long-term leverage has improved significantly, with the gearing ratio dropping from 19.2% to 9.4% as bank loans were repaid.",
      "Working capital (net current assets) remains robust at £78,658, though it has contracted by approximately 12% compared to the prior year.",
